 "_why_here": "The chargen extract (Core Book 1) sends you to 'The Worlds of 2300AD, page 23' for nationality and homeworld. That table is NOT in the chargen extract -- it lives in Core Book 2. Without it there is no homeworld list, no gravity, no Survival DM and no Path.",
 "_key_finding": "PATH IS NOT A FREE CHOICE. Hard/Soft Path is a property of the COLONY, not something the player picks. Choosing a nationality and then a homeworld determines Path, Gravity and Survival DM together. The chargen text reads as though Philosophy were chosen; this table is what actually assigns it.",
