 "_tier_rule": "Tier is the SECOND character of the UCP. Core Book 2 pdf 20: 'The next letter, rather than the Size code, instead references the Tier of the home country.' Validated against the book's own prose: France reads 1 and the text calls the French Empire Tier 1; Australia reads 3 and Book 1 p16 says 'Australia is a Tier 3 nation'.",
 "_tech_level_rule": "Tech Level is the last character of the UPP, after the dash, read as hex (A=10, B=11, C=12).",
